{"sample_id": "aishell5_attr_001_DX01C01_w0000", "dataset": "aishell_5", "subset": "eval1", "protocol": "msswift_window", "language": "zh", "window_start": 0.0, "WavPath": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix-clean/mesh_eval/data/native/eval_clips/speaker_attribution/aishell_5/aishell5_attr_001_DX01C01_w0000.wav", "text": {"utterances": [{"id": "0", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "读吧。", "start": 3.966, "end": 4.466}, {"id": "1", "speaker": "P0128", "text": "*情景三。", "start": 12.016, "end": 13.596}, {"id": "2", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "是聊天儿还是读啊。", "start": 13.436, "end": 14.616}, {"id": "3", "speaker": "P0128", "text": "场景三读吧。", "start": 14.416, "end": 15.936}, {"id": "4", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "我读吧。", "start": 18.436, "end": 19.326}, {"id": "5", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "聊天儿。", "start": 21.13, "end": 21.71}, {"id": "6", "speaker": "P0128", "text": "聊天儿啊，啊，好，开始。", "start": 24.186, "end": 26.236}, {"id": "7", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "今日气温不正常啊。", "start": 26.786, "end": 28.916}, {"id": "8", "speaker": "P0128", "text": "是。", "start": 28.986, "end": 29.736}, {"id": "9", "speaker": "P0128", "text": "忽冷忽热爱感冒，甲流儿现在。", "start": 29.926, "end": 30.0}]}, "n_speakers": 2, "n_utterances": 10, "capability": "speaker_attribution", "source_index": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix/smoke_attr_all/aishell_5/manifest.jsonl"}
{"sample_id": "aishell5_attr_003_DX01C01_w0440", "dataset": "aishell_5", "subset": "eval1", "protocol": "msswift_window", "language": "zh", "window_start": 440.0, "WavPath": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix-clean/mesh_eval/data/native/eval_clips/speaker_attribution/aishell_5/aishell5_attr_003_DX01C01_w0440.wav", "text": {"utterances": [{"id": "0", "speaker": "P0188", "text": "我*。", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.466}, {"id": "1", "speaker": "P0187", "text": "嗯。", "start": 1.786, "end": 2.406}, {"id": "2", "speaker": "P0188", "text": "奶奶也给我换过东西。", "start": 2.556, "end": 4.276}, {"id": "3", "speaker": "P0187", "text": "什么呀。", "start": 4.256, "end": 4.886}, {"id": "4", "speaker": "P0187", "text": "大飞机呀。", "start": 6.956, "end": 7.826}, {"id": "5", "speaker": "P0188", "text": "不是，不是积木类的。", "start": 8.586, "end": 10.246}, {"id": "6", "speaker": "P0187", "text": "那不就那个汽车吗。", "start": 11.516, "end": 12.926}, {"id": "7", "speaker": "P0188", "text": "也不对，也不对。", "start": 13.546, "end": 15.646}, {"id": "8", "speaker": "P0187", "text": "嗯。", "start": 14.356, "end": 14.846}, {"id": "9", "speaker": "P0187", "text": "那你说。", "start": 15.926, "end": 16.666}, {"id": "10", "speaker": "P0188", "text": "嗯。", "start": 17.926, "end": 18.426}, {"id": "11", "speaker": "P0187", "text": "那你说。", "start": 18.556, "end": 19.326}, {"id": "12", "speaker": "P0188", "text": "就是那小汽车儿。", "start": 21.6, "end": 22.96}, {"id": "13", "speaker": "P0187", "text": "你骗我是吧，那没奖励了。", "start": 23.296, "end": 25.676}, {"id": "14", "speaker": "P0187", "text": "嗯说错晚了。", "start": 27.186, "end": 28.566}]}, "n_speakers": 2, "n_utterances": 15, "capability": "speaker_attribution", "source_index": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix/smoke_attr_all/aishell_5/manifest.jsonl"}
{"sample_id": "aishell5_attr_005_DX01C01_w0320", "dataset": "aishell_5", "subset": "eval1", "protocol": "msswift_window", "language": "zh", "window_start": 320.0, "WavPath": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix-clean/mesh_eval/data/native/eval_clips/speaker_attribution/aishell_5/aishell5_attr_005_DX01C01_w0320.wav", "text": {"utterances": [{"id": "0", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "嗯就是，你还好多都关门了你知道吧。但人也有挣钱的，也有发财的。", "start": 0.0, "end": 2.84}, {"id": "1", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "嗯。", "start": 0.106, "end": 0.666}, {"id": "2", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "*那都是属于少数，嗯多数的话这种，靠天吃饭自然进客进店儿的这种都不行。", "start": 3.01, "end": 10.22}, {"id": "3", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "是。", "start": 3.336, "end": 3.906}, {"id": "4", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "是，是。", "start": 10.376, "end": 11.016}, {"id": "5", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "哎呀，反你愿意去，你可以换一个再换一个那个卖房子的话，你再换一个不又半年这个，是吧。", "start": 12.936, "end": 21.706}, {"id": "6", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "哦，哦，对对。哦，对我就碰机会吧。", "start": 17.806, "end": 23.156}, {"id": "7", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "*换，又半年这个无责任的这种底薪这种，也挺好。", "start": 23.11, "end": 27.33}, {"id": "8", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "啊，对。", "start": 24.626, "end": 25.926}, {"id": "9", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "啊，碰机会吧。我主要是现在想学这个卖房子嘞。", "start": 26.646, "end": 30.0}]}, "n_speakers": 2, "n_utterances": 10, "capability": "speaker_attribution", "source_index": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix/smoke_attr_all/aishell_5/manifest.jsonl"}
{"sample_id": "aishell5_attr_006_DX04C01_w0560", "dataset": "aishell_5", "subset": "eval1", "protocol": "msswift_window", "language": "zh", "window_start": 560.0, "WavPath": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix-clean/mesh_eval/data/native/eval_clips/speaker_attribution/aishell_5/aishell5_attr_006_DX04C01_w0560.wav", "text": {"utterances": [{"id": "0", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "车太多了那天。", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.196}, {"id": "1", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "大正月人都没事。", "start": 2.39, "end": 4.06}, {"id": "2", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "就来回串。", "start": 5.04, "end": 7.02}, {"id": "3", "speaker": "P0128", "text": "哦。", "start": 7.436, "end": 8.466}, {"id": "4", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "主要我也不好事。", "start": 9.1, "end": 10.46}, {"id": "5", "speaker": "P0128", "text": "嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯。", "start": 11.75, "end": 13.17}, {"id": "6", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "要好事的话每天要出去。", "start": 12.38, "end": 14.63}, {"id": "7", "speaker": "P0128", "text": "唉呀，我跟你说那男的就是像你这就够可以了，你也不抽烟是吧。", "start": 15.056, "end": 21.116}, {"id": "8", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "嗯，不抽烟喝酒喝酒，嗯嗯，少喝点儿。", "start": 20.99, "end": 25.56}, {"id": "9", "speaker": "P0128", "text": "也不喝酒，这酒喝酒是吧，少喝一点儿是吧啊，少喝点儿就是。", "start": 21.426, "end": 26.656}, {"id": "10", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "嗯。", "start": 26.27, "end": 26.99}, {"id": "11", "speaker": "P0128", "text": "少喝一点儿，自己炒好菜了，你知道，哎呀，挺好的，少喝点儿喝二两就行了。", "start": 26.96, "end": 30.0}, {"id": "12", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "不不呃，嗯嗯，就每天晚上少喝点儿，嗯嗯。", "start": 27.72, "end": 30.0}]}, "n_speakers": 2, "n_utterances": 13, "capability": "speaker_attribution", "source_index": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix/smoke_attr_all/aishell_5/manifest.jsonl"}
{"sample_id": "aishell5_attr_008_DX03C01_w0240", "dataset": "aishell_5", "subset": "eval1", "protocol": "msswift_window", "language": "zh", "window_start": 240.0, "WavPath": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix-clean/mesh_eval/data/native/eval_clips/speaker_attribution/aishell_5/aishell5_attr_008_DX03C01_w0240.wav", "text": {"utterances": [{"id": "0", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "啊，还没有，就是抓学习那个啥，光提溜家长，光给我说，啊你明天要不抱孩子来这儿，陪孩子上学吧，光吓唬我这你知道呗，就怕孩子学习跟不上。", "start": 0.0, "end": 6.89}, {"id": "1", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "为，为啥呀。", "start": 3.536, "end": 5.046}, {"id": "2", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "不是为啥。", "start": 7.31, "end": 8.48}, {"id": "3", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "嗯，老师说嗯全班听写嘞，嗯，你给他听写嗯对了几个，我说，嗯，错了三四个，老师说人家都一个没错，我说，呀。", "start": 7.4, "end": 17.67}, {"id": "4", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "嗯。", "start": 14.796, "end": 15.296}, {"id": "5", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "啊。", "start": 16.776, "end": 17.296}, {"id": "6", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "我第二天我就把孩子那学习都抓一个也不错，*后来老师就不抓我了，人家都一个都不错。", "start": 18.02, "end": 25.17}, {"id": "7", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "啊。", "start": 21.396, "end": 21.936}, {"id": "8", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "切，我们孩子到现在都对几个，对不了几个。", "start": 25.06, "end": 27.87}, {"id": "9", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "我想也是，他不准是一个也不错吧，反正他就是这么严啊，他就是这样，就是就光抓这，别的咱还是没有啥。", "start": 27.336, "end": 30.0}]}, "n_speakers": 2, "n_utterances": 10, "capability": "speaker_attribution", "source_index": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix/smoke_attr_all/aishell_5/manifest.jsonl"}
{"sample_id": "aishell5_attr_010_DX01C01_w0120", "dataset": "aishell_5", "subset": "eval1", "protocol": "msswift_window", "language": "zh", "window_start": 120.0, "WavPath": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix-clean/mesh_eval/data/native/eval_clips/speaker_attribution/aishell_5/aishell5_attr_010_DX01C01_w0120.wav", "text": {"utterances": [{"id": "0", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "房山那个溶洞。", "start": 0.0, "end": 1.456}, {"id": "1", "speaker": "P0128", "text": "哦哦哦。", "start": 1.246, "end": 2.366}, {"id": "2", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "看着它那溶洞*不大那溶洞是是好看。", "start": 1.706, "end": 5.216}, {"id": "3", "speaker": "P0128", "text": "嗯。", "start": 5.366, "end": 6.156}, {"id": "4", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "那溶洞自然的自然形成的那个溶洞是吧。", "start": 5.866, "end": 9.656}, {"id": "5", "speaker": "P0128", "text": "嗯。", "start": 9.266, "end": 9.886}, {"id": "6", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "特别美，嗯嗯。", "start": 10.256, "end": 13.376}, {"id": "7", "speaker": "P0128", "text": "对，有条件就出去转一圈，没条件就。", "start": 11.166, "end": 14.366}, {"id": "8", "speaker": "P0128", "text": "就在家服务好就行了是吧。", "start": 14.666, "end": 17.136}, {"id": "9", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "嗯。", "start": 15.896, "end": 16.686}, {"id": "10", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "呃因为因为丈人他病的时候。", "start": 17.386, "end": 21.826}, {"id": "11", "speaker": "P0128", "text": "嗯。", "start": 21.516, "end": 22.516}, {"id": "12", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "过来。", "start": 23.276, "end": 24.426}, {"id": "13", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "我去北京给老二看孩子。", "start": 25.266, "end": 29.286}, {"id": "14", "speaker": "P0128", "text": "嗯。", "start": 28.936, "end": 29.816}, {"id": "15", "speaker": "P0127", "text": "孩子才八个月。", "start": 29.876, "end": 30.0}]}, "n_speakers": 2, "n_utterances": 16, "capability": "speaker_attribution", "source_index": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix/smoke_attr_all/aishell_5/manifest.jsonl"}
{"sample_id": "aishell5_attr_012_DX01C01_w0400", "dataset": "aishell_5", "subset": "eval1", "protocol": "msswift_window", "language": "zh", "window_start": 400.0, "WavPath": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix-clean/mesh_eval/data/native/eval_clips/speaker_attribution/aishell_5/aishell5_attr_012_DX01C01_w0400.wav", "text": {"utterances": [{"id": "0", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "啊，卖房子反正我觉着我嗯。", "start": 0.0, "end": 1.7}, {"id": "1", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "你卖卖卖出单了呗。", "start": 0.256, "end": 2.196}, {"id": "2", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "嗯，反正是租房子还行，卖这一块儿我我还是不熟。", "start": 2.97, "end": 8.31}, {"id": "3", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "在在哪个学学校啊是，在在啊，在哪个中介啊。", "start": 8.19, "end": 12.34}, {"id": "4", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "在哪个中介，在一世家和，嗯，就是，啊，新新的就是。", "start": 10.276, "end": 18.316}, {"id": "5", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "啊，我知道一世家和，呃在那个万达那儿对面儿有一个嘞。", "start": 13.24, "end": 17.66}, {"id": "6", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "那你可以再继续干那个。", "start": 18.576, "end": 20.426}, {"id": "7", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "啊，我还是想干那个，想干那个还自由。", "start": 20.186, "end": 23.876}, {"id": "8", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "那个他他那底薪多少钱他一个月。", "start": 24.126, "end": 26.806}, {"id": "9", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "底薪一千五那会儿吧，都五五六年了吧。", "start": 26.75, "end": 30.0}]}, "n_speakers": 2, "n_utterances": 10, "capability": "speaker_attribution", "source_index": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix/smoke_attr_all/aishell_5/manifest.jsonl"}
{"sample_id": "aishell5_attr_013_DX04C01_w0360", "dataset": "aishell_5", "subset": "eval1", "protocol": "msswift_window", "language": "zh", "window_start": 360.0, "WavPath": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix-clean/mesh_eval/data/native/eval_clips/speaker_attribution/aishell_5/aishell5_attr_013_DX04C01_w0360.wav", "text": {"utterances": [{"id": "0", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "这就是属于那种一一朝被蛇咬十年怕井绳。", "start": 0.0, "end": 1.126}, {"id": "1", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "啊，就胆儿小。", "start": 0.536, "end": 2.096}, {"id": "2", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "有啥呀，太想的太，他们就是想的太复杂了，你知道呗。", "start": 1.976, "end": 7.206}, {"id": "3", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "就以前我弟开门市时候，净那小闺女儿在门市招你知道呗，白天黑嘞都都，都围着我弟转，他不上心他都，你说这叫啥事儿。", "start": 6.42, "end": 16.59}, {"id": "4", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "嗯。", "start": 10.136, "end": 10.716}, {"id": "5", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "嗯。", "start": 12.46, "end": 13.04}, {"id": "6", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "不不不上个心。", "start": 17.65, "end": 19.12}, {"id": "7", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "啊现在这人都成这了，我。", "start": 18.996, "end": 22.386}, {"id": "8", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "你现在，现在属蛇那可不嘞三十二三了，你再找也就找二十七八的。", "start": 21.55, "end": 27.81}, {"id": "9", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "不能再小了，再小嗯人家。", "start": 28.386, "end": 30.0}, {"id": "10", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "你再，你你再小二十五六你都小你都小八九岁你能行啊。", "start": 29.2, "end": 30.0}]}, "n_speakers": 2, "n_utterances": 11, "capability": "speaker_attribution", "source_index": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix/smoke_attr_all/aishell_5/manifest.jsonl"}
{"sample_id": "aishell5_attr_015_DX03C01_w0080", "dataset": "aishell_5", "subset": "eval1", "protocol": "msswift_window", "language": "zh", "window_start": 80.0, "WavPath": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix-clean/mesh_eval/data/native/eval_clips/speaker_attribution/aishell_5/aishell5_attr_015_DX03C01_w0080.wav", "text": {"utterances": [{"id": "0", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "就是然后人家发现啦，人家发现就不干啦，不干嗯不干啦非得非得要打人，我说打人咱也不怕是吧。", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.17}, {"id": "1", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "啊打你啊。", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.89}, {"id": "2", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "打打我我也不怕，不行我认了，关键我怕他去俺家里闹去，你知道呗，去俺家里闹，然后我，俺家人知道了不好这事儿。", "start": 0.756, "end": 9.656}, {"id": "3", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "啊。", "start": 2.01, "end": 2.72}, {"id": "4", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "啊。", "start": 3.13, "end": 3.9}, {"id": "5", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "啊啊。", "start": 5.72, "end": 6.66}, {"id": "6", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "啊啊。", "start": 8.91, "end": 10.0}, {"id": "7", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "哎呀，把我吓毁了，你知道呗。", "start": 10.976, "end": 13.016}, {"id": "8", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "啊。", "start": 12.886, "end": 13.406}, {"id": "9", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "嗯我吓毁啦，后来我说我说我我我不要工资了，我啥也不要了，我我就不来啦，我都然后他说没事没事你该去还去公司，就是说知道这事了，嗯，也不啊他也不会咋的就。", "start": 13.43, "end": 27.17}, {"id": "10", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "啊。", "start": 20.586, "end": 21.066}, {"id": "11", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "也没啥，你就把那钱给他们不就行了。", "start": 24.826, "end": 28.236}, {"id": "12", "speaker": "P0173", "text": "嗯好，没有没有给他，没给他就是说显着*不好看呗，嗯，最后嗯反正就没没法再去啦，就是。", "start": 28.286, "end": 30.0}, {"id": "13", "speaker": "P0174", "text": "后来给他啦。", "start": 29.53, "end": 30.0}]}, "n_speakers": 2, "n_utterances": 14, "capability": "speaker_attribution", "source_index": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix/smoke_attr_all/aishell_5/manifest.jsonl"}
{"sample_id": "aishell5_attr_017_DX01C01_w0140", "dataset": "aishell_5", "subset": "eval1", "protocol": "msswift_window", "language": "zh", "window_start": 140.0, "WavPath": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix-clean/mesh_eval/data/native/eval_clips/speaker_attribution/aishell_5/aishell5_attr_017_DX01C01_w0140.wav", "text": {"utterances": [{"id": "0", "speaker": "P0188", "text": "八点去学校，然后十一点半放学，然后下午就是，你一点四十到学校，然后，然后，下午三点，三点。", "start": 0.0, "end": 6.32}, {"id": "1", "speaker": "P0188", "text": "半，三点四十就放学啦。", "start": 6.96, "end": 10.57}, {"id": "2", "speaker": "P0188", "text": "我哥就是跟我我就不迟到了我是。", "start": 16.76, "end": 19.79}, {"id": "3", "speaker": "P0187", "text": "我跟你可不一样，你刚才说那些有一些可是错嘞，礼拜一到礼拜四咱们上学的时间，是在，七点四十到八点十分儿只要在这个时间你进去就行了。", "start": 18.85, "end": 30.0}]}, "n_speakers": 2, "n_utterances": 4, "capability": "speaker_attribution", "source_index": "/mnt/afs/users/wangyl/VoxMatrix/smoke_attr_all/aishell_5/manifest.jsonl"}
